OL,3,GNEWSAPassengers sleep on floors and
OL,4,Adescribe airport 'carnage' as hundreds
OL,5,Amore flights cancelled
OL,6,
OL,7,FImages show passengers sleeping on
OL,8,Fairport floors as hundreds more flights
OL,9,Fare cancelled and delayed after
OL,10,Fyesterday's technical problem at air
OL,11,Ftraffic control
OL,13,FSome 1,750 flights were cancelled on
OL,14,FTuesday, according to aviation
OL,15,Fanalytics firm Cirium, with hundreds of
OL,16,Fthousands of passengers thought to have
OL,17,Fbeen affected by the chaos
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
